      "title": {
        "en": "How are things?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "To ask how someone is doing, say *co słychać?* or *co nowego?* to anyone. To a friend it is *co u ciebie?*; to a man you call *pan*, *co u pana słychać?*, and to a woman, *co u pani słychać?*. Turn the question back with *a u ciebie?*, *a u pana?* or *a u pani?*."
      },
